    <view class="pg07-welcome"><view class="pg07-welcome-row"><view class="pg07-orb"><view class="pg07-orb-glow"></view><view class="pg07-orb-disc"><image src="./assets/pg07-smile.svg" mode="aspectFit" aria-hidden="true"/></view><view class="pg07-orb-badge"><view class="pg07-orb-ping"></view><view class="pg07-orb-dot"></view></view></view><view class="pg07-welcome-copy">这里会更新活动动态；有问题，可以直接问主办方 ✨</view></view><view class="pg07-ambient"></view></view>
